# Panes of the RetroBoot window (the classic panel's main list): startup, update, clock,
# profiler; chip, its processor meter; and Display & Sound's bevel buttons (monitor_page,
# sound_page, keyboard).  Original RetroBoot pixel art in the spirit of Mac OS 8/9
# Platinum; no Apple bitmaps were copied or traced.  On a device with the Platinum bundle
# these names draw the user's own Mac OS control panel icons instead (src/assets.c); this
# art is the fallback (no bundle yet, or a Mac OS without that control panel).
# One character per pixel; letters come from palette.txt, "." is transparent.

# Startup Disk: the hard disk (as disk).
